                      "kind": "strong",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "（1）算法基本设计思想"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "将数组视为前p个元素组成的子数组a和后n-p个元素组成的子数组b。通过三次逆置操作实现循环左移：先逆置a，再逆置b，最后逆置整个数组。即先将数组ab转换为a⁻¹b，再转换为a⁻¹b⁻¹，最终得到ba。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "strong",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "（2）算法描述（C语言）"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "code",
              "value": "void Reverse(int R[], int from, int to) {\n    int i, temp;\n    for (i = 0; i < (to - from + 1) / 2; i++) {\n        temp = R[from + i];\n        R[from + i] = R[to - i];\n        R[to - i] = temp;\n    }\n}\n\nvoid Converse(int R[], int n, int p) {\n    Reverse(R, 0, p - 1);       // 逆置前p个元素\n    Reverse(R, p, n - 1);       // 逆置后n-p个元素\n    Reverse(R, 0, n - 1);       // 逆置整个数组\n}",
              "block": true,
              "lang": "c"
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "strong",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "（3）时间复杂度和空间复杂度"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "时间复杂度：O(n)，其中三次逆置操作总代价为O(p + (n-p) + n) = O(n)。"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "空间复杂度：O(1)，仅使用常数个临时变量。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
